Hold":9.905,"id":"L007"},{"actor":"sami","start":43.463,"text":{"en":"The thing, not the person. The wood, the parts.","ar":"الشيء، لا الشخص. الخشب، الأجزاء."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"layla","start":48.541,"text":{"en":"We use the passive to talk about the process.","ar":"نستخدم المبنيّ للمجهول للحديث عن العمليّة."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"layla","start":52.443,"text":{"en":"When the thing is more important than the person.","ar":"حين يكون الشيء أهمّ من الشخص."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"layla","start":56.225,"text":{"en":"Now the rule. The active names who does the action.","ar":"الآن القاعدة. المبنيّ للمعلوم يسمّي من يقوم بالفعل."},"id":"L011"},{"actor":"layla","start":61.591,"text":{"en":"The carpenter cuts the wood.","ar":"النجّار يقطع الخشب."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"layla","start":64.389,"text":{"en":"The passive is is or are, plus the past participle.","ar":"المبنيّ للمجهول هو is أو are، مع اسم المفعول."},"id":"L013"},{"actor":"layla","start":69.035,"text":{"en":"The wood is cut. The parts are sanded.","ar":"الخشب يُقطع. الأجزاء تُصنفر."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"sami","start":73.489,"text":{"en":"Is or are? One sofa.","ar":"Is أم are؟ كنبة واحدة."},"subHold":7.321,"id":"L015"},{"actor":"sami","start":80.81,"text":{"en":"Is. The sofa is made.","ar":"Is. الكنبة تُصنع."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"sami","start":84.544,"text":{"en":"Is or are? Many parts.","ar":"Is أم are؟ أجزاء كثيرة."},"subHold":7.486,"id":"L017"},{"actor":"sami","start":92.03,"text":{"en":"Are. The parts are joined.","ar":"Are. الأجزاء تُوصل."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"layla","start":95.572,"text":{"en":"If you must name the person, add by.","ar":"إن كان لا بدّ من تسمية الشخص، أضف by."},"id":"L019"},{"actor":"layla","start":99.33,"text":{"en":"The sofa is made by the workshop.","ar":"الكنبة تُصنع من قِبل الورشة."},"id":"L020"},{"actor":"layla","start":102.776,"text":{"en":"But in a process we usually do not need it.","ar":"لكن في العمليّة لا نحتاج ذلك عادةً."},"id":"L021"},{"actor":"sami","start":106.582,"